WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.700
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.570
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.530
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.130 --> 00:01:11.800
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:36.400
I'm Kurata Sana, a TV personality
and 6th grader--

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:38.950
Right, right, we don't have time
for that today! This is awful!

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.740
Go to last week's VTR, and start!

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:41.910
Rei...

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:45.750
A visitor?

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:46.410
Asako-san...!

00:01:46.410 --> 00:01:50.080
Asako-san was here!?
Asako-san came to see you, Rei-kun!?

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.380
She came inside the house!?
So, what is it with her!?

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:56.720
No! No! Rei-kun, you're my boyfriend,
after all!

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:59.640
"Tweet-tweet, Love Flies Away"

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:04.100
Calm... down...
you're disgracing yourself.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:05.430
Mama, why--

00:02:05.430 --> 00:02:07.440
--did you let Asako-san--

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.440
--in the house!?

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:09.770
Huh?

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:11.770
Silence.

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:16.440
Sana, do you think that your love
for Sagami-kun is the real thing?

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:18.110
You're not listening to me, are you?

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:21.780
I- I am listening to you! And my
love for Rei-kun is the real thing!

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:24.790
Rei-kun is my pimp and my boyfriend!

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:26.450
S- Sana-chan...

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:27.790
Isn't that right, Rei-kun?

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.790
Do not... ignore... your mother.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.750
Gripes! How come you're butting in!?

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:36.420
I was talking to Rei-kun!

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.430
They ran away on me
while I was talking...

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:42.930
"It remains unresolved..."

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:43.430
What is this!? What's going on!?
What's going on, I said!

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.430
Grumble, grumble, grumble, grumble...

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:46.430
S- Sana-chan?

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:47.980
What's the matter?

00:02:50.100 --> 00:02:53.770
Rei-kun has been running away
from me for some reason ever since.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.570
He's not answering his
Burutcha at all, either.

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:04.450
I-I-I b-b-brought y-y-you
s-s-some t-t-tea...

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.330
Thank you.

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:10.080
S- sorry.

00:03:17.460 --> 00:03:20.800
Why don't you take your
Burutcha out of your pocket?

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:22.300
No, I'm all right.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:27.810
Sagami-kun, that's your way of
showing consideration for Sana, huh?

00:03:27.810 --> 00:03:31.770
Sana-chan really is an
important little girl to me.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:36.730
Which is why... which is why
I don't want to hurt her in any way.

00:03:39.070 --> 00:03:43.740
Thank you. I'm sure she will come
to realize that any time now, too.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:47.450
Begging your pardon, but Sensei, please
come to a realization yourself, and fast!

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:52.420
Listen to me,
your deadline is in one hour!

00:03:52.420 --> 00:03:55.080
If your manuscript is late this time,
I'll have to face the editor--!

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.420
I speak, and this is what happens.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:04.090
Why won't the sensei give me her
manuscripts on time? Is it me--?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.850
Ciao!

00:04:13.440 --> 00:04:16.110
Sensei! Are you trying
to make a fool of me!?

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:20.780
Sensei! Please, wait up! Sensei!

00:04:26.450 --> 00:04:30.120
Ah, what on earth are
those two thinking!?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:34.420
♪ I don't get it! It's bothering me!
I don't know what's going on! ♪

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:36.380
♪ It's bothering me
that under I don't stand! ♪

00:04:36.380 --> 00:04:38.380
♪ You don't get it, I don't get it! ♪

00:04:38.380 --> 00:04:40.380
♪ Who does get it? I don't know! ♪

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.760
♪ Paipo-popaipo-pankuracho! ♪

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:44.050
Sana-chan is stranger than usual today.

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.720
Strange, like she's been
possessed by something.

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.760
Excuse me!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:49.760
Yes?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:52.140
Is Sana-chan here?

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.730
Well, Sana-chan is sort of...

00:04:55.730 --> 00:04:57.730
...busy right now, being strange.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.730
Can't I see her?

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:02.440
It's just...

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:03.740
Right now isn't...

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:05.450
I don't get it any of it!

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:07.740
Ah, it's Sana-chan!

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:15.460
Yay! An actual autograph
from Sana-chan!

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.630
I always see you on TV!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:20.090
How cute!

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:23.760
(For the moment, Sana forgets about
her love troubles and calms down.)

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.430
So, what grade are you in?

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:27.760
Second grade.

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:29.800
Oh, yeah? What's your name?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.720
Huh? Aono!

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.720
What? Tsuyoshi-kun, you know her?

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.390
She's my sister.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:37.400
Oh, is that right?

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:39.060
Whoa, really?

00:05:39.060 --> 00:05:40.730
I'm his sister.

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:45.150
Wow, so you have a sister, Tsuyoshi-kun?
How nice, how nice, how nice!

00:05:45.150 --> 00:05:46.400
Let me have one too, okay, okay, okay?

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.360
I've only got the one.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.740
It's Akito!

00:05:51.740 --> 00:05:52.740
Yo, squirt!

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:55.370
Aono! You mustn't go near Akito.

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.410
There's no telling
what he will do to you.

00:05:56.410 --> 00:06:00.420
No! Let me go, Big Brother! No!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.750
Let me go, I said, Big Brother!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.590
The strap! The strap!
The strap is going to break!

00:06:09.430 --> 00:06:13.100
That was mean! Don't pull on my handbag.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.100
S- sorry.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.440
Aono-chan, what do you
have in your handbag?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.100
An egg!

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.770
An egg?

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:23.770
You know what? When you make an egg warm,
it turns into a chick. Did you know that?

00:06:23.770 --> 00:06:26.360
That's why Aono is keeping it warm.

00:06:28.450 --> 00:06:31.700
Say, is it actually some special egg
that a chick will hatch from?

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:34.950
Uh-uh, it's the regular kind
they sell at the supermarket,

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:36.830
in packs of six, for ¥158.

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:39.580
That's stupid, isn't it?

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.380
Hayama?

00:06:41.380 --> 00:06:43.380
Go on and eat it, right away.

00:06:43.380 --> 00:06:45.380
There's no way that thing is
going to turn into a chick--

00:06:48.380 --> 00:06:51.390
Is that right? Well, I bet you can't
wait for it to become a chick, huh?

00:06:51.390 --> 00:06:52.050
Mm-hmm!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:53.050
"To Aono-chan, Kurata Sana"

00:06:53.050 --> 00:06:55.390
Good luck with your work!

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.390
Mm-hmm, thank you!

00:06:57.390 --> 00:07:00.390
Ooh, she's so cute, so cute, so cute!

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.850
I know...!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.400
I snuck out at lunch recess
and bought it.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.900
Wow, how cute.

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.410
Sana-chan, is that...?

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:15.080
You think it would be okay if I secretly
switched it with Aono-chan's egg?

00:07:15.080 --> 00:07:17.750
Mm-hmm, I'm sure Aono will be thrilled.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.330
Don't do it.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:25.090
Not you again...

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.090
Think about it a little harder, dimwit.

00:07:27.090 --> 00:07:29.420
"Dimwit"!?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:33.590
If you do something pointless like that,
she's going to believe the mistaken notion

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:37.060
that a regular egg will
hatch if you warm it up.

00:07:37.060 --> 00:07:39.640
When she gets older, and embarrasses
herself by telling others about it,

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:42.060
it's going to be your fault, you...

00:07:42.060 --> 00:07:44.730
...dimwitted dimwit-man.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:47.400
Dimwitted dimwit-man!?

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.070
What's the big idea,
you dumb-dumb-dummy-man!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:54.070
The truth isn't always necessarily
the best thing, you know!

00:07:54.070 --> 00:07:57.410
You know! You know! You know! You know!

00:07:57.410 --> 00:08:01.330
There was something that
Mama said to me this one time!

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:04.540
Sana...

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.170
Sana...

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:13.090
Reality, Sana, is something
you'll have to know about,

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:16.760
whether you want to or not,
when you grow up. So...

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:21.100
So for now, you don't
have to know about it.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:25.440
Yes, you should just dream along.
That's what children should do.

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:27.480
You get it, Hayama!?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.780
No, I don't.

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:36.160
Why, you...! You three-story
reinforced-concrete hardhead!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:39.370
Ah, Sana-chan!

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.370
What did you need from Aono?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:42.710
U- um...

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:45.040
Ah! There are people watching us on TV!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:46.420
Huh? Where? Where?

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:49.710
Aono doesn't know what you mean.

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.210
Which brings us to your egg, Aono-chan!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.720
It's been born!

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:58.720
Look! It happened, Sana-chan!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.060
It happened all right, Aono-chan!
That was your egg!

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:04.890
It's so cute! Aono-chan's chick!

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:07.860
Good for you, Aono-chan!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:14.740
This is no time to be loafing around!

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:18.780
"Zenjiro's "Child's Toy""

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:22.080
Calligraphy Special!!

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:26.210
"Calligraphy Competition"

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.580
Okay now, everybody,
go ahead and write like crazy!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.250
Write! Write! Write! Write! Write! Write!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:29.420
Heh, it really was a good
thing I gave her that chick.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.420
I've calmed down

00:09:30.420 --> 00:09:32.340
and completely forgotten about
whatever it was that was bothering me.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:35.380
Ah, I just remembered.

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:37.340
Asako-san at my house...!

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.060
It's bothering me! It's bothering me!

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:43.350
Done writing?

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:46.020
Sana has to leave a little early.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.100
See ya.

00:09:48.150 --> 00:09:52.400
"It's bothering me"

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:50.690
I wand-uh if something's bothering her.

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.610
That is what it says.

00:09:52.610 --> 00:09:54.740
This week, Zenjiro-chan.

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.700
What sloppy handwriting!

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:58.030
It's bothering me!
It's bothering me! Asako-san!

00:09:58.070 --> 00:10:00.240
It's bothering me! It's bothering me!
Rei-kun running away!

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:04.540
Rei-kun!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.710
Rei-kun!

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.420
S- Sana-chan?

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:12.380
You're not running away
from me any longer!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:17.380
Rei-kun, what were you doing yesterday?
Why did Asako-san come over?

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.720
S- Sana-chan...

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.760
Answer me, would you?

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:24.850
Rei-kun, you said you wouldn't have
anything to do with Asako-san, right?

00:10:24.850 --> 00:10:25.770
Right? Right?

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.980
So then, why?
Rei-kun, you're my boyfriend!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.360
Welcome back, Sana.

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:37.030
Mama! Don't interfere!

00:10:37.030 --> 00:10:39.320
I was waiting, thinking you'd
figure it out for yourself,

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.700
but I guess it's no use.

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.700
W- what are you talking about?

00:10:42.700 --> 00:10:47.000
What's between you and Sagami-kun,
quite frankly, is not love!

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:53.040
You probably take it to be love, but that
is by no means the case with Sagami-kun.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:53.710
S- Sensei...!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:57.050
You may have the appearance of an adult,
but you are still a child.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:11:01.050
Sagami-kun is an adult, and you
cannot be the object of his affection.

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:05.390
W- what are you saying?
Rei-kun is my boyfriend, and my... my...

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.390
Pimp?

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:10.230
Do you even know what
"pimp" really means?

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:16.070
Among the general public,
it's something to be ashamed of.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.400
And about that allowance
that you give him--

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:21.860
After Sagami-kun gets it,
he brings it to me.

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:28.410
Sagami-kun gets his wages
from me, after all.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:32.460
I've been depositing the money you've
been giving him under your name.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:37.420
It's not true... It's not true...

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.420
It's not true...

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:44.090
It's not true, right?
Rei-kun, say it isn't true! Rei-kun!

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.600
Is it true...?

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.780
Then, it is...

00:12:01.780 --> 00:12:05.780
Him, a boyfriend?
He's just pretending, you know.

00:12:05.780 --> 00:12:06.780
You were...

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.290
You were just pretending, after all!?

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:14.290
I was the only one who misunderstood...?

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.130
Sana-chan, that's not--

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:19.210
That's right! You misunderstood!
Ah, how embarrassing!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:23.800
You're just a simple child!
Just like with this children's lunch!

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:25.800
Sensei, that was cruel!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.810
What's so wrong about
telling her the truth?

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:30.310
How can you laugh at a child
about being a child!?

00:12:31.140 --> 00:12:33.060
S- Sana-chan!

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:35.400
No... No...!

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:37.400
No!

00:12:37.400 --> 00:12:40.070
Rei-kun is my boyfriend and my pimp.

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:43.400
I'm feeling so good right now,
I'm going to be especially generous!

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:46.740
Rei-kun, you're my boyfriend, after all!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:53.040
I'm so... I'm so...
terribly embarrassed!

00:13:02.260 --> 00:13:03.590
¥206.

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:05.260
That's too much. Charge me less.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:07.300
Thank you.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.440
I didn't get a good look...

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:23.110
...but there can only be one girl
with legs that fast.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.450
Hey!

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:33.910
Hayama...

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.040
W- what's the matter?

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:40.590
T- there's something I...

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:43.920
...I'm terribly embarrassed about.

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.260
I can't ever...

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.430
I can't ever return home again.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.930
You can't go home? If you can't
go home, what will you do?

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:55.770
Find some faraway, unknown city...

00:13:56.230 --> 00:14:08.320
"The Floral Path of Erika"

00:13:56.940 --> 00:14:08.410
♪ Sana... Sana... will start again...
will start again from Square One. ♪

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:12.280
What are you talking about?

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:17.290
It turns out that Rei-kun was
just treating me like a child.

00:14:17.290 --> 00:14:21.290
Ha, didn't I tell you so?
You finally caught on, huh?

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:24.630
He's infuriating, isn't he?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.300
I'm not angry at him.

00:14:27.300 --> 00:14:29.590
I'm just ashamed of myself.

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:33.560
Ah, that chick...!

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:38.560
It's just like with that chick.
Aono-chan's egg wouldn't have hatched.

00:14:38.560 --> 00:14:41.560
It's a chick that
allows her to dream a lie.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:47.320
Rei-kun also gave me a chick.
Is that how this is?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:54.910
I wonder if Aono-chan will be this
embarrassed when she realizes her mistake.

00:14:54.910 --> 00:14:57.250
Yes, she will.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:59.920
That's why I told you
not to give her that chick.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:03.170
And if you had never
met Sunglasses-san,

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:04.590
you wouldn't have
had to go through this.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:06.760
No way!

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:11.590
I may not like how embarrassed
I feel right now, but, but, but...

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:15.930
I couldn't stand never
having met Rei-kun even more!

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:16.930
Is that right?

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:21.400
That's right! Mm-hmm,
I'm sure of it! That's right!

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:26.570
And Aono-chan would mu-ch rather have
met her chick and be embarrassed about it,

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:27.610
than to never have seen it at all!

00:15:27.610 --> 00:15:29.610
Nope.

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:31.780
I think it'd be better for her if she
didn't have to go through the trouble

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.160
she'll get from ever having seen it.

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:45.540
You really do say the exact
opposite of everything I do, huh?

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.880
You're right.

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.210
--It's positively...
--It's positively...

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:50.840
--...sickening.
--...comical.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:15:58.600
It's positively...

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.600
--...sickening!
--...comical!

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:01.270
--Sickening!
--Comical!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.560
--Sickening!
--Comical!!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:07.610
These two are diametric opposites.

00:16:07.610 --> 00:16:08.900
You want to go at it!?

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:11.280
You're such a brat when it
comes to this, you dimwit.

00:16:11.280 --> 00:16:14.570
Brat...!?

00:16:14.570 --> 00:16:18.740
Mm-hmm. Let's go home already.
I'm hungry.

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:21.580
No way!

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.290
I'm so embarrassed, I can't go home!

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:27.170
You don't say. Well, suit yourself.

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:30.630
H- hey...

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.300
He-y!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:34.890
Hey! Hey! Hey...!

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:37.220
He really did head home.

00:16:37.220 --> 00:16:39.310
What a cold fellow.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:46.900
Maybe I really should
find a faraway city.

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:51.900
Bobbing along on the waves...
The Mariana Trench Traveler's Inn...

00:16:52.900 --> 00:16:56.240
In any event, I can't go back home.

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:00.080
Ah, it's too humiliating!

00:17:04.250 --> 00:17:08.290
You know, you've always
been liked by everybody.

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:10.880
I don't think you need to be
so concerned about your disgrace.

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.510
I mean, just between you and me,

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:18.600
I get pretty embarrassed when I think
about the way I was a little while ago.

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:23.020
Oh, is that so?
Yeah. Sure you would be.

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:26.270
You were a lot
more extreme than me, huh?

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:28.610
You were the scum of the class, after all.

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:30.940
Even so...

00:17:30.940 --> 00:17:34.030
Even so, you stood by me
and listened to what I had to say,

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:36.860
despite the way I was, right?

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:38.530
N- now that you mention it...

00:17:38.530 --> 00:17:42.410
isn't that just the way relationships
between people work, though?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:48.000
Take Sunglasses-San. It's not as though
he hates you or anything, right?

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:52.210
Right?

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:53.510
Mm-hmm.

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:01.310
That's Mama's car-- the special
remote control version.

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:11.730
"Daughter-- The streets
are dangerous at night.

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:14.230
Come home soon. Mother and Rei."

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:21.530
Why don't you go home?

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:24.240
Yeah...

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:29.920
Thanks, Hayama. If I hadn't run into you,

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:34.170
I might have run off to some
far away city and ruined my life.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.550
Hey!

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:38.550
Thanks, I said!

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:41.220
Hey!

00:18:41.220 --> 00:18:43.890
I said thanks!

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:44.890
You jerk!

00:18:44.890 --> 00:18:48.230
I'm thanking you here!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.150
Shut up! I heard you!

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:54.570
Say--

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:56.110
What?

00:18:57.570 --> 00:19:00.910
Why did you kiss me?

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:05.830
I just can't put it
out of my head, you know?

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.420
I don't hate you, that's why.

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:17.920
What does that mean!?
Do you kiss everyone you don't hate!?

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.930
Do you hate this guy?

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:20.930
Not especially.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:22.260
Fine!

00:19:22.260 --> 00:19:24.890
If you don't hate him,
then give him a kiss!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.770
Cut it out, you dumbass!

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:32.850
Stop acting so ridiculous
and get yourself home!

00:19:32.850 --> 00:19:36.940
Ha! You don't have to tell me!
I'm going home!

00:19:37.860 --> 00:19:40.860
What's his deal!?

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:49.200
Still, he did genuinely
listen to what I had to say.

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:52.210
I guess even he has a few good points.

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:54.210
But only a few.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.960
Although, all good people
have their bad points,

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:58.880
and all bad people
have their good points.

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:02.220
Well, I guess there
are all sorts of people...

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.930
"Welcome back, Sana"

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.100
Welcome back.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:10.230
I- I'm home.

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:12.890
Hurry and go eat your dinner.

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:17.570
Shimura-san knocked herself out making
Thai-style eggplant-and-shrimp curry.

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:19.900
It would be a shame
if you didn't have some.

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:26.240
Rei-kun...?

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:27.330
Welcome home.

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:36.840
Rei-kun, do you like Asako-san?

00:20:37.960 --> 00:20:38.630
Mm-hmm.

00:20:38.630 --> 00:20:39.960
"Back in high school"

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:42.470
I haven't moved on.

00:20:41.300 --> 00:20:52.980
My face always used
to appear in your eyes.

00:20:42.470 --> 00:20:45.970
In my mind, I haven't changed
at all since high school.

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:48.640
It's okay.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:51.980
You can get back with Asako-san.

00:20:51.980 --> 00:20:56.980
I understand what your
feelings are, Rei-kun.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:58.320
Feeling lonely during the long nights,

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:59.320
I gave a chick to Aono-chan, myself.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:21:04.990
the palms of your large hands
were so gentle.

00:20:59.320 --> 00:21:00.980
A chick?

00:21:00.980 --> 00:21:05.990
The time when I can dream,
thanks to you, Rei-kun, is now over.

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:15.670
I can't yet be the rose,
shining brighter than anyone else.

00:21:05.990 --> 00:21:07.660
I'm a little bit sad about that.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:10.330
But only a little bit,
so I'll be all right.

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:13.660
Oh, keep working as my manager
the way you've been doing up to now.

00:21:13.660 --> 00:21:15.670
Sana-chan...

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:27.590
Good-bye love, I hope you at least
believe that my love was real.

00:21:15.670 --> 00:21:18.340
I'll be all right, so...

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.340
H- huh...?

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.340
Sana-chan...

00:21:22.340 --> 00:21:27.590
That's weird of me, huh? I'm all right...

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:37.940
Good-bye love, someday,
I'm sure I'll be able to walk alone,

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:29.600
I'm all right, so why...

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:32.020
...am I crying...?

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:49.780
but until that day, but until
that day, stay by my side.

00:21:57.290 --> 00:22:09.300
Good-bye love, I hope you at least
believe that my love was real.

00:22:05.300 --> 00:22:10.300
Mama said that this
wasn't genuine love...

00:22:09.300 --> 00:22:19.980
Good-bye love, it will be along time
before my dream comes true,

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:14.310
...but I do think that Rei-kun
was my first love.

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:19.980
I'd like to think that these
feelings of mine are the real thing.

00:22:19.980 --> 00:22:29.660
so just a little while longer, just a
little while longer, stay by my side.

00:22:22.320 --> 00:22:27.900
And as long as I think so, it's okay
to go on believing it, right?

00:22:27.900 --> 00:22:29.660
That's okay, right?

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:42.290
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.790 --> 00:22:47.800
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.050 --> 00:22:52.550
In dire straits,

00:22:53.310 --> 00:22:56.140
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:23:00.020
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.070
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:11.110
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:13.330
...panic!!

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:19.210
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:21.880
he's there.

00:23:22.790 --> 00:23:25.130
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.710
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:30.260
...for two.

00:23:31.090 --> 00:23:33.720
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:38.480
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:42.020
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.230 --> 00:23:46.730
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.650 --> 00:23:52.320
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.490 --> 00:23:54.990
he's there,

00:23:55.950 --> 00:23:58.160
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:00.790
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.290
...for two.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:10.130
Hoy! In Sana-chan's next adventures...

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:14.140
If I keep gnashing around like this,
I'm going to become a gnat!

00:24:14.140 --> 00:24:15.800
I wish I hadn't said that.

00:24:15.800 --> 00:24:18.810
Huh? Father Hayama,
nice to see you again.

00:24:18.810 --> 00:24:20.480
But no sooner does it
happen than he collapses!

00:24:20.480 --> 00:24:23.480
No, no! Father Hayama, don't die!

00:24:23.480 --> 00:24:25.190
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,

00:24:25.190 --> 00:24:27.730
Episode 11 of the Uneasy Night
of Impressions and Departures Saga:

00:24:27.730 --> 00:24:29.400
"Father, You Are His Father"

00:24:29.400 --> 00:24:32.780
Father, you are his father!
Hayama, hang in there!

00:24:32.780 --> 00:24:35.450
I don't get all of this,
but I'm concerned.
